/-
kvraft's and kvcheck's proofs (the part `KvRaft/`, `notes/kvraft-part.md`), every proof applied to
its callees' results: the part's own, and raft-noax's, `durable`'s, lintest's, porcupine's and
Perennial's linked results (their `Link.lean`s, used as they are). The callees are read off each
proof's binders; a proof generic in kvraft's model parameters is linked at the store's
(`etc/link_kvraft.py`'s docstring). Generated by `etc/gen-link.py --kvraft` -- do not edit by hand.

152 results, 152 of them with no hypothesis. The others take, as hypotheses, the specs no result
proves and the hypotheses of the linked results they use: none.

`#print axioms` on a result is its trust base.
-/
